Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:00.88,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿Por qué nadie te elige
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:01.44,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}aunque lo des todo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:02.00,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}A lo mejor eres
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.01,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la persona que más da
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.01,0:00:03.69,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la que siempre está
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.69,0:00:04.99,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la que nunca se queja
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.99,0:00:05.57,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la que siempre dice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:06.53,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que sí cuando quiere decir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:06.88,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:07.61,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y nada de eso hace
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.61,0:00:07.96,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que te elijan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:08.71,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y que te respeten
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:09.42,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}porque se nota
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:10.11,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que lo estás haciendo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.11,0:00:10.85,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}para que te quieran
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.85,0:00:11.59,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y por eso la persona
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.59,0:00:12.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que menos da a veces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.73,0:00:13.45,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}es la más valorada
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:14.00,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y tú que lo das
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:14.32,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:15.38,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}acabas sintiendo que nunca
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:16.19,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}es suficiente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.19,0:00:16.50,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Entonces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:17.01,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿qué cambia?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:17.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Dos cosas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:18.51,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}La primera es que cuando
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.51,0:00:19.67,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}dices que sí queriendo decir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:19.99,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:21.16,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te estás traicionando y eso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:22.60,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te hace bajar tu energía
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:23.00,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y por tanto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:23.56,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tu autoestima
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:24.50,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y la gente lo nota
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:25.58,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}aunque no sepa explicarlo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.58,0:00:26.19,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y la segunda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:27.22,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}es que no te eliges
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:27.70,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tú primero
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:28.59,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y no desde el orgullo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:29.37,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}sino el respeto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.37,0:00:30.16,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y piénsalo bien
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:30.74,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}nadie se va a quedar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:31.43,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}al lado ni va
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.43,0:00:32.12,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}a respetar a nadie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.12,0:00:32.93,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que no se respeta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:33.98,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Yo llegué a ganar 17.000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:34.66,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}euros en un mes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:34.92,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y aún
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.92,0:00:35.72,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}así me sentía vacío
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:36.59,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}porque estaba buscando
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.59,0:00:37.96,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que todo mi valor proveniera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:38.74,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de lo externo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:39.62,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Así que deja de darlo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:40.65,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}todo para que te quieran
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.65,0:00:41.72,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y empieza a dártelo tú
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:42.37,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Porque cuando elevas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.37,0:00:43.21,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tu energía y mejoras
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:43.86,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tu autoestima
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.86,0:00:44.69,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la gente que te quiere
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:45.76,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y te valora llega sola
